ned it, and it must remain within 120 feet of that creature. If it strays further than 120 feet, it vanishes and reappears within 1 day within 10 feet of its bonded friend. It is destroyed if its bonded friend dies.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"dBbIkJ5jJCYEd0Ny","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688751796063,"modifiedTime":1688751816135,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Natural Invisibility","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A imaginary friend is naturally @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Invisible]{Invisible} to all creatures except for its bonded friend.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"lT9bC2eCM0mtukRu","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688751797182,"modifiedTime":1688751949067,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Imaginary Shield","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature attempts a melee Strike against the imaginary friend's bonded friend</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The imaginary friend Steps. If it ends its movement adjacent to its bonded friend, the imaginary friend takes the damage from the Strike instead of its bonded friend. The imaginary friend's resistance applies to this damage, but the resistance isn't doubled even if the attack was non-magical.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"LrO0i8XoEZLMZVws","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688751894223,"modifiedTime":1688751927043,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Together, Charge!","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The imaginary friend's bonded friend Strides.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The imaginary friend Strides twice and makes an imaginary sword Strike. As long as the imaginary friend moved at least 20 feet, it gains a +2 circumstance bonus on its attack. If the bonded friend is equal or lower level than the imaginary friend, the bonded friend gains a +2 circumstance bonus to its next attack. After using this ability, the imaginary friend is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Stunned]{Stunned 2}.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-su-effects.Item.zXOxw4fmCG8oS9ry]{Effect: Together, Charge!}</p>"},"rules":[{"domain":"all","key":"RollOption","option":"together-charge","toggleable":true,"value":false},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"imaginary-sword-attack","value":2,"type":"circumstance","predicate":["together-charge"]}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"MN8rc3PgBtnvRmxV","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688751956212,"modifiedTime":1688752432217,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Imaginary Sword","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[{"domain":"damage","key":"RollOption","label":"Use Imaginary Sword Two-Handed","option":"two-handed","toggleable":true,"value":false},{"key":"DamageDice","label":"PF2E.TraitTwoHandD12","override":{"dieSize":"d12"},"predicate":["two-handed"],"selector":"{item|_id}-damage"}],"slug":"imaginary-sword","traits":{"value":["force","magical","two-hand-d12"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"pqSY5FlhoCI0itd5":{"damage":"1d8+5","damageType":"force","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":16},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"jshPP966V50nnguU"